OL,4,CTwo Italians killed in strike in       
OL,5,CKuwait, as Iran denies responsibility  
OL,6,GTwo Italian nationals have died        
OL,7,Gfollowing a strike on a facility in    
OL,8,GKuwait which both countries have       
OL,9,Gblamed on Iran.                        
OL,11,FThe pair were technicians working for  
OL,12,FGerman arms manufacturing company      
OL,13,FRheinmetall, Italy's foreign ministry  
OL,14,Fsaid.                                  
OL,16,FIran has denied responsibility for the 
OL,17,Fattack, with Foreign Minister Abbas    
OL,18,FAraghchi saying the incident looked    
OL,19,F"suspicious" and that Tehran would     
OL,20,Fwork with Kuwait and Italy to          
OL,21,F"determine the cause".                 
